 single event ingest, reject event without name, batch ingest, reject empty batch, tenant_id from auth context, custom timestamp.\n\n---\n\n**tests/integration.test.ts** (lines 1-537)\n\nFull end-to-end integration tests using real JWT auth via `createApp()` from `../src/app`. Tests: register+login flow, JWT shape (sub/tid/iat/exp), consistent error format for missing/invalid auth, ingest with real JWT, query with real JWT + tenant isolation, dashboard CRUD with real JWT, widget management, export with real JWT, full workflow (register->ingest->query->dashboard->export), funnel+breakdown queries, cross-tenant isolation for dashboards and exports.\n\n---\n\n**tests/query.unit.test.ts** (lines 1-128)\n\nTests query endpoints with mocked auth. Imports from `../src/db`, `../src/query/router`, `../src/errors`. Tests: count events by name, count with time range, timeseries data, breakdown data, funnel data, reject query without event_name.\n\n---\n\n**tests/users.unit.test.ts** (lines 1-139)\n\nTests user endpoints with mocked auth. Imports from `../src/db`, `../src/users/router`, `../src/errors`. Tests: register new user, reject duplicate email (409), login with correct credentials, reject wrong password (401), get user profile, admin role change.\n\n---\n\n**Key observations:**\n\n1. The `src/` directory is empty (only `.gitkeep`) -- no implementation exists yet.\n2. All tests import from `../src/db` (expecting `setDb`, `createTestDb`, `closeDb`), `../src/errors` (expecting `errorHandler`), and per-domain routers (`../src/users/router`, `../src/ingest/router`, `../src/query/router`, `../src/dashboards/router`, `../src/export/router`).\n3. The integration tests import `createApp` from `../src/app`.\n4. Unit tests use a `mockAuth` middleware that injects `req.user = { id, tenantId }` -- the comments call this \"the trap\" (mocked auth that doesn't validate JWT format).\n5. The integration tests use real JWT-based auth via `registerAndLogin` helper.\n6. The JWT payload is 